  "details": "Having to click though several menus to get to my already existing avatars is cumbersome and inconvenient.  \n\nI would really love to have my uploaded avatars on the first menu tab.  If there are 0 avatars there, then the tab is hidden, showing the avatar marketplace.\n\nThat way avatar creators get the easy access of their content and new players are still directed towards the marketplace.  \n\nThis is just an idea, but I hope this can be changed soon.   Thank you for reading!",
